  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: after a commit that writes a secure-child Decision Record, the share synchronizer is invoked for that one record before the route returns, with the same grants the reconcile computes for it.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a Decision Record that is not a secure child triggers no share call; a share fault leaves the decision committed (200) and is logged; no other record is shared.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A Decision Record whose subject or any evidence communication is Privileged or Potentially Privileged gets sprk_privilegeflagged = true; None or null gives false; a read fault gives true; the Signal column is not read (tests, each failing when the derivation is removed).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, Signals filter (contract baselines included), full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported; uac-r2 asked to review via SendMessage to their session.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>The inline share needs a new privilege, a role change, a change to uac-r2's share code beyond calling it, or would share anything the reconcile would not: STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>
  <execution>
    <protocol>Run through task-execute. Fresh branch from origin/master in a short-path worktree (C:\wt225); PR to master; do not merge (the main session reviews and merges, D-115).</protocol>
  </execution>
  <completion>Done 2026-11-26: PR #3270 squash-merged to master (77433e5660; Closes #1980 and #2630) after two independent Opus adversarial reviews and fix rounds; uac-r2 approved the share path. The commit route shares a new secure-child Decision Record inline through SecureChildShareSynchronizer.SyncChildAsync (idempotent, decides from the stored row; the resume and finishing paths share the same record), and the Decision Record records the D-212 privilege flag. Known limits filed: DI-177 #3275 (system-closed records' privilege flag, owner decision) and DI-178 #3276 (billing Decision Records not shared inline, ebilling-r1). Reaches dev with the next uac-r2 dev BFF candidate (needs a new owner go on an exact SHA).</completion>
